7. Feature Engineering

Two important analytical variables were created.

7.1 Discount Value
df['discount_value'] = df['price'] - df['final_price']

This calculates the monetary value of the discount applied to each product.

7.2 Estimated Revenue
df['revenue_estimate'] = df['final_price'] * df['units_sold']

This provides an estimated revenue measure based on final price and units sold.

Important Interpretation

revenue_estimate is an analytical estimate, not verified transaction revenue, because the notebook derives it mathematically from the available fields.

